est in  punishing anybody for not following them  and we're going to try to change those  rules as soon as possible for you  there's a really important keyword in  there they talk about small businesses  we don't support actions against small  businesses this is a complete and total  ruse which has been created to give the  impression that net neutrality hurts  small businesses and small ISPs the  reality is that destroying net  neutrality is a way to help ISPs and  major businesses stand to gain millions  upon millions of dollars and it's a  trick they are trying to trick people  yes this doesn't affect small businesses  this affects large media conglomerates  and I would love to hear Donald Trump  articulate his position on net  neutrality oh yeah we didn't hear any of  that during the debates no we heard he's  against it we heard it's bad he's  against that in he's against anything  Obama has done the way in which small  businesses are being sort of used as a  ploy to convince people about how bad  net neutrality is reminds me of the  cigarette Lobby the cigarette Lobby  funded by major major big tobacco  started going through small bars and  restaurants I believe it was mostly in  the 70s although it may have been even  earlier than that they would show up at  bars and restaurants and they would say  hey listen smoking bans that the local  legislature is trying to pass those are  really bad for you because if people  can't come to your restaurant or your  bar and smoke they're going to go  elsewhere it's gonna be really bad for  you no it turned out it was bogus if you  can't smoke in any bars or restaurants  people still go they either smoke before  after or step outside during we figure  that out the reality was it was framed  as helping small business to keep  smoking bans out it was actually all a  ploy to help big tobacco and this is the  exact same thing that I believe is going  on here with net neutrality this is one  where you can activate you can contac